  "notes": "Poznote self-hosted notes app. Very restrained gray/white UI; the only color is a teal-blue (#007db8) for the active rail icon, search-scope icons, create button and active tab top border, plus a yellow bell. Folder counts are tiny gray pill badges. Note shown in preview mode (Switch to edit mode button), markdown rendered with an H1 underlined by a hairline rule and a code block with language chip ('HTTP') and faint hover tools (collapse, wrap, line numbers, copy). Outline panel exists off-canvas right, toggled by a small chevron tab at top-right. Toolbar is a centered row of line icons without labels."
